## 🔒 SECURITY RULES — NEVER VIOLATE

```
1. NEVER expose secret keys in NEXT_PUBLIC_ variables or client-side code
2. FamGateway webhooks MUST use crypto.timingSafeEqual HMAC-SHA256 verification
3. Download tokens MUST be max 15 minutes TTL, AES-256-GCM encrypted
4. Admin routes MUST check ADMIN_ACCESS_SECRET header first
5. Cron routes MUST validate CRON_SECRET
6. Prices MUST be computed server-side from DB, never trust client-sent prices
7. NEVER commit .env.local or any secrets to Git
8. Paid ebook files MUST stay in private_storage, never in public/ folder
```

---

## 📋 CODING STANDARDS

```
Language    : TypeScript strict mode (web) / Python 3.11+ (Telegram/scripts)
Style       : Tailwind CSS only — zero inline styles
Components  : React Server Components default; 'use client' only when truly needed
SQLite      : import { DatabaseSync } from 'node:sqlite'  ← NOT sqlite3/better-sqlite3
Validation  : Zod for all external API inputs and AI outputs
Errors      : try/catch on all DB and API calls, never silent failures
Images      : Sharp for resizing; label unverified as "Cover not verified"
API routes  : Validate auth headers; correct HTTP status codes on errors
Git         : feat: / fix: / chore: prefixes on commits
Test before commit: node tests/master_system_verification.mjs
Build before push : npx next build (must be 0 errors, 339 routes)
```

